Cloudflare AI Gateway Architecture
Cloudflare AI Gateway Architecture
Architecture: Frontend → Cloudflare Pages Function (proxy) → Cloudflare AI Gateway → AI Model
API keys kabhi bhi frontend React code mein nahi aayenge. Sab AI calls ek Cloudflare Pages Function (server-side) ke through jaayengi.
File Structure for AI Proxy:
functions/
api/
ai/
chat.ts # Food Assistant chatbot
recipe.ts # Recipe Generator
meal-plan.ts # Meal Planner
image-analyze.ts # Image Analyzer
How It Works:
React frontend calls /api/ai/recipe (POST)
Cloudflare Pages Function receives request
Function calls Cloudflare AI Gateway URL with CF_AI_GATEWAY_TOKEN (secret)
AI Gateway routes to @cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct or LLaVA
Response returns to frontend
AI Gateway Setup (Cloudflare Dashboard):
• Create AI Gateway in Cloudflare dashboard
• Gateway URL: https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/{account_id}/{gateway_name}/
• Rate limiting aur caching AI Gateway level par configure
Models Used:
• Text AI (Recipe Gen, Meal Planner, Chatbot): @cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct
• Image AI (Image Analyzer): @cf/llava-hf/llava-1.5-7b-hf
Rate Limiting Strategy:
• Guest: 3 AI requests per IP per hour
• Registered User: 20 AI requests per hour
• Enforced at Cloudflare Pages Function level
Security Requirements
Security Requirements
• API Keys: VITE_ prefix wale variables sirf public Supabase anon key ke liye. AI gateway token aur service role keys sirf Cloudflare environment variables mein (never in code)
• Supabase RLS: Har table par Row Level Security enabled. Users apna hi data read/write kar sakte hain
• Admin Authorization: Admin routes /admin/* par double-check: authStore.role === 'admin' + Supabase RLS policy
• Input Validation: Zod schemas from aur backend dono par. AI prompt injection se bachne ke liye user input sanitize ho
• CORS: Cloudflare Pages Functions mein strict origin check
• Image Upload: File type validation (JPEG, PNG, WebP only), max 5MB, Supabase storage policies
• XSS: React ka default HTML escaping + dangerouslySetInnerHTML use nahi karein
• Auth Tokens: Supabase JWT auto-refresh; expired sessions clean logout
