Healthy Food Hub — UI/UX Design Brief
Design Philosophy
Design Philosophy
Style: Modern Clean Health — fresh, light, trustworthy. Green aur white dominant palette. Professional lekin approachable. Jaise ek premium health magazine ka digital version.
Core Principles:
• Food First: Recipes aur food imagery hero hain — large, appetizing photos dominant
• Clarity: Information hierarchy clear ho — user ko scan karna aasaan lage
• Delight: Subtle animations aur micro-interactions jo experience ko lively banayein
• Consistency: Same component shapes, spacing, colors across all pages
• Accessible: High contrast, large tap targets, readable font sizes
• AI-Forward: AI features visually distinct — purple accent color se highlight
Inspiration References:
• Minimalist: Clean white space, card-based layout
• Healthy vibe: Fresh greens, warm whites, natural photography
• Professional: Not childish — similar to Healthline, EatingWell, or Minimalist Baker
DO NOT:
• Overly busy layouts
• Neon colors ya aggressive gradients
• Cheap stock photo feel
• Heavy drop shadows (use subtle ones only)
